
[[Category:Books]]
''The Microcontinents: A Natural History ''is a 10-book series by [[Malcolm Moreau]], that describe hypothetical ecosystems that may have existed in Earth's distant past on landmasses that have not left any fossil record. Each book in the series was styled as a "field guide" to a different prehistoric landmass at a different time.  

